# Trivy vulnerability waiver policy for docker-aseprite-headless.
#
# - PR builds (.github/workflows/lint.yml) enforce severity=CRITICAL with
#   ignore-unfixed=true so unfixable upstream Ubuntu base-image CVEs do not
#   block unrelated pull requests while fixable CRITICAL CVEs fail the gate.
# - Nightly and release builds (.github/workflows/base.yml) enforce
#   severity=CRITICAL with ignore-unfixed=false.
# - Any temporary CVE waiver added here MUST include the CVE ID, reason, and
#   an explicit expiration date (for example: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:2026-12-31).
